<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medicis.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medicis.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Roberston Stephens raised estimates on Medicis Pharmaceutical Corp and reiterated a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1998 EPS estimate to $2.76 from $1.28 and raised 1998 revenue estimate to $58.6 million from $36.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Noted the company has exceeded expectations for new product intriductions, revenue growth and profitability.</p>
<p>-- Expects company to launch an additional internally developed drug by the end of June and possibly spend some of its $90 million in cash on another acquisition by Q497.</p>
</text>
